    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Content Approval Requests\n\nEvery 15 minutes: takes the OLDEST Content Calendar row with Status = Pending Review, marks it Awaiting Response straight away, emails vbllawchambers@gmail.com an Approve / Decline request, and writes back Approved or Rejected (no answer within 2 hours counts as Rejected).\n\nOne row per run, on purpose. \"Send and wait\" holds a run for up to 2 hours; a run that looped over several rows left the later ones at Pending Review, so the next 15-minute run emailed them again and the first run later overwrote the answer. Now each row has its own run, and several pending rows are emailed 15 minutes apart.\n\nBefore writing the answer, the row is read again: if its Status is no longer Awaiting Response (changed by hand in the Sheet during the wait), it is left alone.\n\nThe publishers only ever touch rows already marked Approved or Retry Pending.\n\nThe Sheet tab is referenced by NAME (\"Untitled\"), as in the other workflows: renaming the tab breaks them until every Sheets node is repointed.\n\n**Before publishing:** Google Sheets credential on all five Sheets nodes, and Gmail.",
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4a0e6c03-1b45-4ce7-aa13-e411bea18c91",
      "name": "Sticky Note 4580cf49",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-800, 600]
    }
  ],
